name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q4_2025'

question 'A food delivery site lets you click a "Show My Order" button, and a summary of your food items instantly appears below it. What part of the website is being changed to make that summary appear?'

wrong 'The website\'s terms of service document'
wrong 'The browser\'s search bar'
wrong 'The internet connection settings'
right 'The HTML structure displayed on the screen'

